{"segment_id": "segment_00012", "start": 360.0, "end": 390.0, "speech": "也就是说，大多数情况下我们聊粤语可能是不合适的。粤语在某些判断语言判断当中，认为真的它就是另一门语言。那他说的这个 different language，我们在这儿理解为可能是方言，对吧？比如说大同话啊，比如说这个呃济南话啊，可能是这些方言。我们去聊一聊这些方言。OK，家庭作业 ask me，先写再朗读。摘要写作先写，然后对答案。Tell the story 口语复述，但是前提是文章要", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000053.webp", "time": 360.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "Topics for discussion", "A foreigner asks you the way from the station", "to your school. Explain it to him.", "Have you ever been abroad? Describe some", "of your difficulties.", "3", "'In England each man speaks a different", "language.' What does this mean? Talk about", "the different'languages' in your country."], "scores": [0.97372, 0.99799, 0.97045, 0.97327, 0.97467, 0.93831, 0.97183, 0.9784, 0.96639, 0.96227], "boxes": [[[1495.0, 48.0], [1737.0, 46.0], [1737.0, 96.0], [1495.0, 98.0]], [[58.0, 135.0], [560.0, 135.0], [560.0, 198.0], [58.0, 198.0]], [[189.0, 332.0], [1227.0, 332.0], [1227.0, 396.0], [189.0, 396.0]], [[188.0, 396.0], [931.0, 390.0], [931.0, 455.0], [188.0, 462.0]], [[186.0, 467.0], [1219.0, 472.0], [1219.0, 541.0], [186.0, 537.0]], [[191.0, 536.0], [625.0, 533.0], [625.0, 599.0], [191.0, 603.0]], [[120.0, 625.0], [156.0, 625.0], [156.0, 663.0], [120.0, 663.0]], [[189.0, 616.0], [1113.0, 616.0], [1113.0, 682.0], [189.0, 682.0]], [[190.0, 678.0], [1207.0, 672.0], [1207.0, 737.0], [190.0, 744.0]], [[191.0, 734.0], [1116.0, 746.0], [1115.0, 811.0], [190.0, 800.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000054.webp", "time": 367.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "Topics for discussion", "A foreigner asks you the way from the station", "to your school. Explain it to him.", "Have you ever been abroad? Describe some", "of your difficulties.", "3", "'In England each man speaks a different", "language.' What does this mean? Talk about", "the different'languages' in your country."], "scores": [0.97592, 0.99826, 0.97396, 0.97412, 0.97767, 0.9789, 0.89582, 0.97044, 0.95183, 0.95792], "boxes": [[[1494.0, 47.0], [1738.0